2-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"cpmlDA2w1wM","position":24,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Angled Face Shapes","track":{"id":"v9z1ZUAheuA","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/angled-face-shapes/","slug":"angled-face-shapes","title":"Angled Face Shapes","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":"images/artists/insightful/tracks/angled-face-shapes.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"FOJqJiwk1vs","position":29,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Dramatic Entrance","track":{"id":"jkByu8BLStQ","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/dramatic-entrance/","slug":"dramatic-entrance","title":"Dramatic Entrance","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":null},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"2dVRfkYMblA","slug":"142","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-142-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #142 w/ Kloud","artwork":"/images/episodes/142.jpg","content":"Co-founder of The Melt \"Kloud\" spins a diverse set of house, R&B, soul, 2-step and bass.\n\n<!--more-->\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10816,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-24T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"TSWoDuUCbAU","position":85,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Angled Face Shapes","track":{"id":"v9z1ZUAheuA","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/angled-face-shapes/","slug":"angled-face-shapes","title":"Angled Face Shapes","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":"images/artists/insightful/tracks/angled-face-shapes.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-M58cuvh5dI","slug":"143","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-143"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #143","artwork":"/images/episodes/143.jpg","content":"Joe Kay focuses playing dropping just over 100 tracks in 3 hours \n\n<!--more-->\n\nIt's been about 3 months or more since there has been no guest on Soulection Radio. \nIt's been an amazing journey of having so many different personalities roll through the station and educate us with their production, selections, knowledge, and experiences. \nThis week Joe Kay wanted to let loose and focus strictly on his selection. Within 3 hours Joe dropped just over 100 tracks, that's right over 100! \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10796,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-08-31T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"sxmhol0uIm4","position":36,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Feeling Quite Large","track":{"id":"6ceGv4ZHljQ","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/feeling-quite-large/","slug":"feeling-quite-large","title":"Feeling Quite Large","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":"images/artists/insightful/tracks/feeling-quite-large.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U3ckiXHBqgw","slug":"147","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-147-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #147 w/ DJ Nobody","artwork":"/images/episodes/147.jpg","content":"We have Low End Theory's very own DJ Nobody in the studio with us. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe hope you're ready for not just another great session of musical selections but also a great 25+ minute discussion between DJ Nobody and Joe Kay. \nJoe kicked things off for a little over an hour & 33 minutes with new and forgotten gems. \n\nDo your research! Nobody made his 1st appearance on the show that was well overdue and went into a heavy/experimental beat journey ranging a variety of BPM's. \nWe discussed a bit of his background and really got into the history of Low End Theory and the progression of where it is today. \nNobody discussed crucial experiences that you would want to know so listen closely. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"VW6R7jdIEQM","position":15,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Feeling Quite Large","track":{"id":"6ceGv4ZHljQ","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/feeling-quite-large/","slug":"feeling-quite-large","title":"Feeling Quite Large","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":"images/artists/insightful/tracks/feeling-quite-large.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"KGbt4wCudfQ","slug":"168","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-168-sxsw"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #168 (SXSW Pre Show)","artwork":"/images/episodes/168.jpg","content":"Joe kay getting you ready for SXSW.\n<!--more-->\n\nAs we are getting ready for SXSW we wanted to get you in the spirit. Joe Kay went solo again to keep things simple and focused. He kicked it off with the new Carmack/Esta collab, played some new discoveries/unreleased gems, and then switched up the whole format by letting the live listener selects the music by sending us our requests via our social media networks. What a beautiful thing! For over 2 hours, you had the chance to selects the music, Joe was just the provider! What a great way to collaborate right? Since we will be at SXSW from (March 11-16) there won't be a live Soulection Radio show next week, however, we do have a special guest mix to make up for it. Stay tuned.\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10818,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-03-08T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"h-jnbjHyozI","position":35,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - Waiting On It","track":{"id":"l_Y7sX9zcdU","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/waiting-on-it/","slug":"waiting-on-it","title":"Waiting On It","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"Insightful"},"artwork":"images/artists/insightful/tracks/waiting-on-it.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"uieVcptzTuA","slug":"292","tags":[6,3,6,15],"links":{"appleMusic":"https://music.apple.com/gb/station/episode-292/ra.1194199131","soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-292"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #292","artwork":"/images/episodes/292.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":7304,"location":"US","published_at":"2017-01-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay’s Session","position":0}},{"id":"lpzmqYGHvHY","position":44,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"Insightful - reflection","track":{"id":"HdpSHJhUEIs","path":"/artists/insightful/tracks/reflection/","slug":"reflection","title":"reflection","artist":{"slug":"insightful","title":"In